<!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->
<section class="sec" id="faqs">
  <div class="wrap faq-g">
    <div class="faq-photos reveal">
      <img class="fp-1" src="/assets/fac-inspection.jpg" alt="SB team inspecting finished harness webbing">
      <img class="fp-2" src="/assets/fac-stitching.jpg" alt="Stitching floor at the SB facility">
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="sec-head left reveal" style="margin-bottom:36px">
        <span class="label">Got Questions?</span>
        <h2>Frequently Asked <em>Questions</em></h2>
        <p>Answers to common questions about certifications, custom manufacturing, MOQs and export.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq reveal"><summary>Do you manufacture custom or private-label gear? <span class="fx">+</span></summary>
        <p class="a">Yes. In-house designers and pattern masters develop products to buyer specifications — from adjusted webbing configurations to fully private-labelled ranges with your branding and packaging.</p></details>
      <details class="faq reveal"><summary>Which certifications and audits do you hold? <span class="fx">+</span></summary>
        <p class="a">Our quality system is certified to ISO 9001:2015 and production is SEDEX-audited for ethical practices. SB International is also a Government of India recognised Export House. Product-level test documentation is shared with quotations on request.</p></details>
      <details class="faq reveal"><summary>Where do you export? <span class="fx">+</span></summary>
        <p class="a">The United States is our largest market, alongside customers worldwide. Export documentation, labelling and packing are all handled in-house.</p></details>
      <details class="faq reveal"><summary>What are your MOQs and lead times? <span class="fx">+</span></summary>
        <p class="a">Both vary by product and configuration. Send your requirement through the quote form and you'll receive MOQ, lead time and pricing together in one response.</p></details>
      <details class="faq reveal"><summary>How is quality controlled? <span class="fx">+</span></summary>
        <p class="a">Dedicated quality controllers inspect at every stage — incoming materials, in-process stitching and hardware, and finished goods — with stringent batch testing before dispatch.</p></details>
      <details class="faq reveal"><summary>How do I get the full catalogue? <span class="fx">+</span></summary>
        <p class="a">Email sales@sbfallprotection.com or submit the quote form and the team will send the latest edition with current specifications.</p></details>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

